{"id": "tatoeba:14028421", "text": "なにその顔？", "lang": "ja", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "jan_OkulaJu", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14028421", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14034470", "text": "今朝は寒いじゃないですか。", "lang": "ja", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "LeviHighway", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14034470", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14035383", "text": "こんにちは、私はベイマックス。あなたの健康を守るケア・ロボットです。", "lang": "ja", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "TanukiKun", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14035383", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14038218", "text": "過去に戻った。", "lang": "ja", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "jan_OkulaJu", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14038218", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14038223", "text": "私たちは過去に戻ることはできない。", "lang": "ja", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "jan_OkulaJu", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14038223", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14038298", "text": "トムは何も聞かなかった。", "lang": "ja", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "ispinoz", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14038298", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14038305", "text": "死ぬほど幸せだ。", "lang": "ja", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "jan_OkulaJu", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14038305", "tier": "short"}
